flowchart TB
  A[Supabase Auth] --> B{Role}
  B --> GM[GM Classification - Internal]
  B --> DM[Department Manager - Internal]
  B --> E[Authorized Engineer - Internal]
  B --> S[Authorized Surveyor - Internal]
  B --> D[Designer - Stakeholder]
  B --> SM[Ship Management - Stakeholder]
  B --> O[Owner - Stakeholder / Read Only]
  B --> Y[Shipyard - Stakeholder / Read Only]

  GM --> P[Create Project + Activate]
  P --> H[Project Health / Milestones / Risks / Decisions]
  P --> PA[Plan Drawing Intake]
  PA --> DM
  DM --> R1{Engineer: Authorization + Competency + Availability + Conflict}
  R1 --> E
  E --> ER[Technical Appraisal + Observation Register]
  ER --> DMR[DM Review Package]
  DMR --> DEC{DM Decision}
  DEC -->|Changes| EFB[Engineer Rework]
  EFB --> E
  DEC -->|Approved| GMA[GM Final Plan Decision]
  DEC -->|Rejected / Amended| GMD[GM Amended Design Decision]
  GMD -->|Return DM| DM
  GMD -->|Send Designer| D
  D --> REV[Controlled Revision + Parent Decision Traceability]
  REV --> DM
  GMA -->|Correction| D
  GMA -->|Approve| APR[Approved + Locked Revision]
  APR --> REL[GM/DM Controlled Stakeholder Release]
  REL --> O
  REL --> Y
  REL --> D
  REL --> SM

  GM --> RFI[Survey RFI]
  RFI --> DM2[DM Scope / Survey Type Review]
  DM2 --> R2{Surveyor: Authorization + Competency + Availability + Conflict}
  R2 --> S
  S --> SR[Survey + Controlled Report + Evidence]
  SR --> SO[Structured Survey Observation Register]
  SO --> DM3[DM Review]
  DM3 --> GM2[GM Final Survey Decision]
  GM2 -->|Approve Clean| FC[Full Certificate]
  GM2 -->|Approve with Open Obs| IC[Interim Certificate]
  GM2 -->|Send Back| CA[Corrective Action]
  CA --> S
  CA --> SM
  S --> EV[Controlled Evidence]
  SM --> EV
  EV --> DMV[DM Verification]
  DMV --> FU[Follow-up RFI]
  FU --> DM2
  SO -->|All cleared| ICF[Finalize Interim -> Full Certificate]
  ICF --> FC

  DM --> RS[Resource Capacity + SLA Engine]
  RS --> ESC[DM Escalation]
  ESC --> GME[GM Escalation Decision]
  GME --> ACT[Assigned Action + Due Date + Linked Task]
  ACT --> H

  H --> CLOSE{Closure Checklist}
  CLOSE -->|All Gates Pass| ARCH[GM Close + Archive]
  CLOSE -->|Gate Fails| OPEN[Continue controlled workflow]

  AUTH[PostgreSQL RLS + SECURITY DEFINER RPC] -.-> B
  AUDIT[Immutable Audit + Document Access Audit] -.-> P
  AUDIT -.-> PA
  AUDIT -.-> SR
  AUDIT -.-> REL
  AUDIT -.-> FC
